{"verses":[{"number":1,"text":"God presides in|strong=\"H7130\"the|strong=\"H8199\"great assembly|strong=\"H5712\".  \nHe|strong=\"H7130\"judges|strong=\"H8199\"among|strong=\"H7130\"the|strong=\"H8199\"gods.   \n"},{"number":2,"text":"“How|strong=\"H4970\"long|strong=\"H5704\"will|strong=\"H7563\"you|strong=\"H6440\"judge|strong=\"H8199\"unjustly|strong=\"H5766\",  \nand|strong=\"H6440\"show|strong=\"H5375\"partiality|strong=\"H5375\"to|strong=\"H5704\"the|strong=\"H6440\"wicked|strong=\"H7563\"?” \\+w Selah|strong=\"H5542\"\\+w*."},{"number":3,"text":"“Defend|strong=\"H8199\"the|strong=\"H8199\"weak|strong=\"H1800\", the|strong=\"H8199\"poor|strong=\"H6041\", and|strong=\"H6041\"the|strong=\"H8199\"fatherless|strong=\"H3490\".  \nMaintain the|strong=\"H8199\"rights|strong=\"H1800\"of|strong=\"H8199\"the|strong=\"H8199\"poor|strong=\"H6041\"and|strong=\"H6041\"oppressed|strong=\"H6041\".   \n"},{"number":4,"text":"Rescue|strong=\"H5337\"the|strong=\"H3027\"weak|strong=\"H1800\"and|strong=\"H3027\"needy|strong=\"H1800\".  \nDeliver|strong=\"H5337\"them|strong=\"H3027\"out|strong=\"H5337\"of|strong=\"H3027\"the|strong=\"H3027\"hand|strong=\"H3027\"of|strong=\"H3027\"the|strong=\"H3027\"wicked|strong=\"H7563\".”   \n"},{"number":5,"text":"They|strong=\"H3808\"don’t know|strong=\"H3045\", neither|strong=\"H3808\"do|strong=\"H3605\"they|strong=\"H3808\"understand|strong=\"H3045\".  \nThey|strong=\"H3808\"walk|strong=\"H1980\"back|strong=\"H1980\"and|strong=\"H1980\"forth|strong=\"H1980\"in|strong=\"H1980\"darkness|strong=\"H2825\".  \nAll|strong=\"H3605\"the|strong=\"H3605\"foundations|strong=\"H4144\"of|strong=\"H3605\"the|strong=\"H3605\"earth are|strong=\"H3045\"shaken|strong=\"H4131\".   \n"},{"number":6,"text":"I|strong=\"H1121\"said, “You|strong=\"H3605\"are|strong=\"H1121\"gods,  \nall|strong=\"H3605\"of|strong=\"H1121\"you|strong=\"H3605\"are|strong=\"H1121\"sons|strong=\"H1121\"of|strong=\"H1121\"the|strong=\"H3605\"Most|strong=\"H5945\"High|strong=\"H5945\".   \n"},{"number":7,"text":"Nevertheless you shall|strong=\"H8269\"die|strong=\"H4191\"like|strong=\"H4191\"men|strong=\"H8269\",  \nand|strong=\"H8269\"fall|strong=\"H5307\"like|strong=\"H4191\"one of|strong=\"H8269\"the|strong=\"H4191\"rulers|strong=\"H8269\".”   \n"},{"number":8,"text":"Arise|strong=\"H6965\", God, judge|strong=\"H8199\"the|strong=\"H3605\"earth,  \nfor|strong=\"H3588\"you|strong=\"H3588\"inherit|strong=\"H5157\"all|strong=\"H3605\"of|strong=\"H3605\"the|strong=\"H3605\"nations|strong=\"H1471\".   \n"}]}
